    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>“Hold still, I’m sewing your courage back on.”</em></p><p>When a friendly creature you can see within <strong>6 squares</strong> fails a defense check, you can use your <strong>reaction</strong> to tug on the invisible seams.</p><ul><li>The ally <strong>rerolls</strong> the defense check and must use the new result.</li><li>You can use this feature a number of times equal to your <strong>tier</strong>, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Soma Break.</li></ul><p><em>Sometimes all a comeback is missing is one stitch in the right place.</em></p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
